  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Total number of atoms in a unit cell<p>No. of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;atom (at face centres)</p><p>No. of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;atom (at all corners)</p><p>So, the formula of compound is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></math></p><p>Now</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/a2604bb1-0253-4229-b94d-b07fc118d1a6-image.png\" style=\"width: 171px; height: 170px;\" /></p><p>If radius of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></math>&nbsp;and radius of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math>&nbsp;then side length&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math></p><p>and face diagonal&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math></p><p>Now Packing fraction&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>volume</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>atoms</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>Volume</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>unit</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cell</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>&#960;R</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>&#960;r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p>Substituting <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>414</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>&#960;R</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>414</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>07096</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>212</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>63</mn></math></p>",
